WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.881 --> 00:00:19.697
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:26.989
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:30.180
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.403
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.403 --> 00:00:40.415
Type your six digits.

6
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:45.787
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:51.362
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

8
00:00:51.362 --> 00:00:57.093
Somebody forgot to check out? You can correct it here.

9
00:00:57.093 --> 00:01:03.755
Find their row and tap Edit Time.

10
00:01:03.755 --> 00:01:08.178
Each time has a switch beside it.

11
00:01:08.178 --> 00:01:13.845
Turn the check-out on.

12
00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:19.544
Set the time they actually left.

13
00:01:19.544 --> 00:01:28.671
Say why. This is optional, but it is what the log will show.

14
00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:36.933
Tap Review Override.
